  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\n1. + and ÷\n\n112 - __**8 ÷ 96**__ + __**16 × 20**__ = 0\n\n⇒ __**112**__ - 0.083 __**+**____** **__**__320__ **= 0\n\n⇒ __**432 - 0.083**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 431.917 ≠ 0\n\n2. - and +\n\n112 + 8 - __**96 ÷ 16**__ × 20 = 0\n\n⇒ 112 + 8 - __**6 × 20**__ = 0\n\n⇒ __**112 +**____** 8**__ - 120 = 0\n\n⇒ 120 - 120 = 0\n\n⇒ 0 = 0\n\n3. × and ÷\n\n112 - 8 + 96 × __**16 ÷ 20**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 112 - 8 + __**96 **____**× 0.8**__ = 0\n\n⇒ __**112**__ - 8 __**+ 76.8**__ = 0\n\n⇒ __**188.8 - 8**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 180.8 ≠ 0\n\n4. - and ×\n\n__**112 × 8**__ + __**96 ÷ 16**__ - 20 = 0\n\n⇒ __**896**____** + 6**__ - 20 = 0\n\n⇒ __**902**____** -**____** 20**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 882 ≠ 0\n\nHence, '**- and +**' is the correct answer.",
